{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 發佈 2026 年節日廣告，短片講述一名年輕男子在收到父母所送的 MacBook Neo 後，重新發現自己的創作能力。這齣名為《The Dreamer》的短片由 Melina Matsoukas 執導。</p>\n<h2>The Dreamer 聚焦重拾創作</h2>\n<p>Apple 在影片簡介中稱，這部節日影片關於一份父母送出的禮物，如何幫助兒子重新發現創作力。簡介又寫道，有時只要有一個相信我們的人，便足以讓我們記起自己為何特別；作品旨在頌揚創意及啟發創意的人，MacBook Neo 亦在片中登場。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 MacBook Neo 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"918\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/macbookneo-1.webp\" width=\"1613\"/></figure>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.676062+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:06:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.985089+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:51.232288+00:00","content_hash":"817e5cd2fb014827d43e1176ec778d8eb84ecd58a3d959b4bf776c4b78f06eb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.676062+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}